              "answers": [
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>NO, both are decongestants but pseudoephedrine is MUCH more effective and has many more side effects. Phenylephrine has been found to be no better as a decongestant than placebo in many clinical trials so next time, consider buying sugar pills instead. They are cheaper.&nbsp;</div>\n",
                    "tip": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": "<div>Indeed, they are very different.&nbsp;both are decongestants but pseudoephedrine is MUCH more effective and has many more side effects. Phenylephrine has been found to be no better as a decongestant than placebo in many clinical trials so next time, consider buying sugar pills instead. They are cheaper.&nbsp;</div>\n"
                  },
                  "text": "It is an oral decongestant that is very similar to phenylephrine (another decongestant)\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "It causes a constriction of the ‘peripheral’ blood vessels, which is the reason it is effective but that can result in an increase in blood pressure\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "It can result in an increase in heart rate, as there is some cross over action on the Beta 1 receptor, especially in higher doses. \n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>It may be associated with dilated pupils because it acts like adrenaline on the alpha 1 receptor </div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>It is a strong stimulant</div>\n"
                }
              ],
